<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50/1.00 off - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50/1.00 off - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts opened $0.50-1.00 lower. Demand light to moderate on a moderate movement. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 58.00-59.00 Few 57.50 &amp; 59.50 US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 53.00-57.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs. 48.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Mostly 1.00 Lower. Top 47.00. US 1-3  300-500 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-47.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs  47.00-47.50</p>
